DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42471::$$$message_0337_0000_0000$$$::"T-Tohsaka!? Fancy running into you here."::
42472::$$$message_0337_0000_0001$$$::"You said it. By the way, Emiya. What are you hiding behind you?"::
42473::$$$message_0337_0000_0002$$$::"Oh, uh, nothing...[wait canskip=0 time=300][l][hffacechg chara=士郎 face=怒 layer=0 time=200][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HRIN3_SHI_0030 _name=士郎] Waah!"::
42474::$$$message_0337_0000_0003$$$::"Look, Rin. It's a letter about the same place you're headed to."::
42475::$$$message_0337_0000_0004$$$::"Archer! When did you get behind me... And why didn't Saber notice[line len=2]"::
42476::$$$message_0337_0000_0005$$$::"Munch munch munch...[lr]::
42477::$$$message_0337_0000_0006$$$::This doner kebab is quite delectable, Archer."::
42478::$$$message_0337_0000_0007$$$::"As you can see, she doesn't miss a beat."::
42479::$$$message_0337_0000_0008$$$::"That makes sense. You're my apprentice, so they would've sent you a letter, too."::
42480::$$$message_0337_0000_0009$$$::"I don't think that's the only reason."::
42481::$$$message_0337_0000_0010$$$::"What was that?"::
42482::$$$message_0337_0000_0011$$$::"Oh, nothing... At any rate, there's no way out for you two."::
42483::$$$message_0337_0000_0012$$$::"But why? If we're headed to the same place, we don't need to fight[line len=2]"::
42484::$$$message_0337_0000_0013$$$::"Then why did you conceal the letter? You know that such naïve thinking will never win you happiness."::
42485::$$$message_0337_0000_0014$$$::"No, um, I just had a hunch that it would be really bad if Tohsaka found out."::
42486::$$$message_0337_0000_0015$$$::"...Funny you should say that, Shirou."::
42487::$$$message_0337_0000_0016$$$::"Oh, um! I didn't mean anything by it[line len=2]"::
42488::$$$message_0337_0000_0017$$$::"It's okay, you don't have to make excuses. I have a feeling you just got wrapped up in this, but... [hffacechg chara=凛 face=怒 time=200][hfstamp layer=0]Let's get serious, Archer."::
42489::$$$message_0337_0000_0018$$$::"Understood.[lr]::
42490::$$$message_0337_0000_0019$$$::This is the best outcome I could hope for, Master."::
42491::$$$message_0337_0000_0020$$$::"Kuh! Looks like we gotta do this.[l][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HRIN3_SHI_0100 _name=士郎] Saber!"::
42492::$$$message_0337_0000_0021$$$::"Om nom, gulp. [wait canskip=0 time=500][l][hffacechg chara=セイバー face=驚 layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HRIN3_SAV_0040 _name=セイバー]Yes. [wait canskip=0 time=500][l][hffacechg chara=セイバー face=怒 layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HRIN3_SAV_0050 _name=セイバー]I won't hold back, no matter who stands in our way!"�:�d